          "handle": "nvidianewsroom",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "In Tokyo today, NVIDIA CEO Jensen Huang joined leaders from Fujitsu, Kawasaki Heavy Industries, FANUC, and Yaskawa Electric.   Together, they’re bringing physical AI from national ambition to the factory floors that power industries around the world.",
